A_fJ-SKLdKaYxFukC6o57cFwO8XIy0gHnOfac&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD0pmCigRTPJ2xUROc13pXXQEPk7a9R1pOjpa5NOgd48Q&oe=6A65F2A1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "288845444875343", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162695_288845451542009_977113993371975680_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rlBU5FzhNL0Q7kNvwGMnWRD&_nc_oc=AdpohQ93zQFBqq8-oWU77I2EX7QDrv_dxpiAXuMGyOt-8J4sQ8LPfM8Z-pg9wtMJw8o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA2foRhsvRA5CpHPMTFVaui2ze5c7GLQ7NLGooBk_PqPw&oe=6A6611EC"}, "display_name": "Jigsaw Puzzle VR", "keywords": ["Jigsaw", "Puzzle", "Game", "VR", "Fun"], "long_description": "For the first time ever, you can enjoy playing jigsaw puzzle in real 3D and in VR. Jigsaw Puzzle VR is a highly appealing game for every gender and age and a real catch for jigsaw puzzle fans. Enjoy playing 25 different puzzles from fantasy characters to cars to animals. Start a relax game with easy mode and challenge yourself all the way to hard mode created for hardcore puzzle fans. Finally have fun playing the game in eye-catching environments designed to immerse you in the gameplay.", "short_description": "For the first time ever, you can enjoy playing jigsaw puzzle in real 3D and in VR. Jigsaw Puzzle VR is a highly appealing game for every gender and age and a real catch for jigsaw puzzle fans. Enjoy playing 25 different puzzles from fantasy characters to cars to animals. Start a relax game with easy mode and challenge yourself all the way to hard mode created for hardcore puzzle fans. Finally have fun playing the game in eye-catching environments designed to immerse you in the gameplay."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://riseangle.com/games/jigsaw-puzzle-vr/jigsaw-puzzle-vr-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://riseangle.com/games/jigsaw-puzzle-vr/terms-of-s